{"product_id":"buture-vc10-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-400w-38kpa-copy","title":"Buture VC10 Cordless Vacuum | Official Refurbished","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuTure VC10 400W\/38KPA Powerful Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with Touch Screen, 55 Min. Autonomy and Removable Battery, LED Light, 4 in 1 Floor\/Carpet\/Dog Hair Vacuum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【 400W\/38Kpa Powerful Vacuum Ceaner】\u003c\/strong\u003eVC10 Cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with the latest 400W brushless motor with 100,000rpm speed and offers 3 suction modes: MIN-17Kpa, MID-25Kpa and MAX-38Kpa for all types of waste. The MAX 38Kpa suction can easily clean up large particles such as dog food.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Touchscreen \u0026amp; Triple Protection】\u003c\/strong\u003eSweeper vacuum cleaners can set the suction power and check the remaining power through the touchscreen. The blockage detection function and three protection programs protect the motor and battery when the vacuum cleaner is blocked or misused, prolonging its life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【55 Mins Autonomy \u0026amp; Replaceable Battery】\u003c\/strong\u003eCordless upright vacuum cleaner uses a 6*2500mAh battery and can work for 20-55 Mins depending on the used vacuum mode. The battery is removable and you can buy additional batteries for longer use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Optimal Filtration】\u003c\/strong\u003eCordless vacuum cleaner adopts H13 Medical grade HEPA, which can filter 99.9% of particles as small as 0.3μm and 95% of bacteria and viruses as small as 0.1μm, preventing of allergies in children and pets. The filters are washable and the package contains 3pcs HEPA.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【Cordless 4-in-1 Stick Vacuum Cleaner】\u003c\/strong\u003eThe floor brush of the stick vacuum cleaner can swivel 180° left and right and 90° up and down, and the LED light on the head helps you clean the dark corners. Equipped with 4 types of brushes and a telescopic tube to clean carpets, hard floors, furniture surfaces, crevices, and high places.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48933160485119,"sku":"VC10FXJ","price":89.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/products\/VC10.jpg?v=1652079168","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-vc10-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-400w-38kpa-copy","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}